# Role "resolver-only": you use someone's public Israel TV catalog and run only the home resolver (Mako playback,
# and geo-blocked Reshet/Kan through a proxy when refused where you are). Nothing is required inside Israel.

# Outside Israel: add the "geo" block from docs/setup/resolver-only.md ("Abroad") to the config too (without it these are not
# used), then fill in the variables it names:
# GEO_PROXY_USERNAME=
# GEO_PROXY_PASSWORD=

# Only with resolver.remote (Mako away from home through your tunnel): openssl rand -hex 32
# ISRAEL_TV_REMOTE_TOKEN=
